        },
        {
          "text": "Basi mfalme akamwambia Yoabu, jemadari wa jeshi la askari, waliokuwa pamoja naye, Zunguka sasa katikati ya kabila zote za Israeli, tangu Dani mpaka Beer-sheba, mkawahesabu watu, nipate kujua jumla ya hao watu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoabu akamwambia mfalme, BWANA, Mungu wako, na awaongeze watu, hesabu yao ikiwa yo yote, mara mia, tena macho ya bwana wangu mfalme na yawaone; ila kwa nini neno hili limempendeza bwana wangu mfalme? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nya 21:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.8.4"
